### 50. My watchlists (LEFT JOIN + COUNT)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/watchlists

### 51. Create a new, empty watchlist (copy its watchlistId)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/watchlists
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Banks" }

### 52. Watchlists again: "Banks" shows items = 0 (kept by the LEFT JOIN)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/watchlists

### 53. Add stocks (INSERT ... SELECT). Paste the id from 51
POST http://localhost:8080/api/watchlists/16760485-ea2a-4b75-87af-6c0a96f5beac/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "symbol": "HDFCBANK" }

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/watchlists/16760485-ea2a-4b75-87af-6c0a96f5beac/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "symbol": "SBIN" }

### 54. Add the same stock again (expect 409 ALREADY_EXISTS: the UNIQUE key)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/watchlists/16760485-ea2a-4b75-87af-6c0a96f5beac/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "symbol": "SBIN" }

### 55. Items with prices and the "owned" badge (LEFT JOIN + EXISTS)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/watchlists/16760485-ea2a-4b75-87af-6c0a96f5beac/items

### 56. Remove one item (multi-table DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/watchlists/16760485-ea2a-4b75-87af-6c0a96f5beac/items/SBIN

### 57. My stocks: watched OR owned (FULL OUTER JOIN)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/my-stocks

### 58. Watched AND owned (INTERSECT)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/my-stocks/watched-and-owned

### 59. Watched but never bought (EXCEPT)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/my-stocks/watch-only

### 60. Activity timeline (UNION ALL)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/my-stocks/activity?limit=10

### 61. Ideas (ANY + NOT EXISTS)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/my-stocks/ideas

### 62. Suggestions (NOT EXISTS)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/watchlists/suggestions

### 63. Delete the watchlist: its item goes too (DELETE with CASCADE)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/watchlists/16760485-ea2a-4b75-87af-6c0a96f5beac

### 64. Alert ABOVE, just over the price (P + 0.1%): fires within seconds as the price wanders
POST http://localhost:8080/api/alerts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "symbol": "RELIANCE", "direction": "ABOVE", "targetPrice": 1196 }

### 65. Alert BELOW, far under the price (P - 20%): stays ACTIVE
POST http://localhost:8080/api/alerts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "symbol": "RELIANCE", "direction": "BELOW", "targetPrice": 950 }

### 66. Same alert again (expect 409: UNIQUE constraint)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/alerts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "symbol": "RELIANCE", "direction": "BELOW", "targetPrice": 950 }

### 67. Unknown stock (expect 404: the INSERT ... SELECT found no such ACTIVE symbol)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/alerts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "symbol": "NOTASTOCK", "direction": "ABOVE", "targetPrice": 100 }

### 68. My alerts (send again after ~10 s: alert 64 becomes TRIGGERED, set by the trigger)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/alerts

### 69. Only triggered ones
GET http://localhost:8080/api/alerts?status=TRIGGERED

